# Format Guide:
# [YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM] Iteration N: {concise summary}
#
# For modules: Added 'name' module → {why} ({how used})
# For decisions: State what + (brief justification)
# For blockers: What failed + action taken
# For completions: What works + metrics (e.g., "23 tests passing")
